# AI-Powered Auto Job Application System

This project is a Flask-based job search and application tracker that helps you:

- upload and manage a resume
- search sample and manually added jobs
- compute job compatibility scores against your profile
- generate cover letters and targeted resume bullet suggestions
- track applications and manage a safe automation configuration

## Features

- Resume upload for PDF and DOCX files
- Skill extraction with keyword-based fallback matching
- Score logic for job compatibility using skills, location, and role fit
- Manual job listing creation and filtered job search
- Cover letter generation with professional fallback text
- Application tracking and dashboard views
- Configurable automatic-apply rules that remain permission-aware and off by default

## Run locally

1. Create a virtual environment and install dependencies:
   ```bash
   python -m venv .venv
   source .venv/bin/activate
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```

2. Start the Flask app:
   ```bash
   flask --app app run --debug
   ```

3. Open the app in a browser at:
   ```text
   http://127.0.0.1:5000
   ```

## Environment variables

You can optionally configure an LLM provider:

```bash
export LLM_PROVIDER=fallback
export OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here
# or
export GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
```

If no API key is configured, the system uses a safe keyword-based fallback so the app still works immediately.

## Important security and compliance notes

- This application does not bypass CAPTCHAs, MFA, login protection, or anti-bot protections.
- Authorized auto apply remains disabled until explicitly enabled in the app settings.
- Any browser automation should only be used on platforms that officially permit it and where the user has confirmed compliance with policy and consent requirements.
